msgstr "Pengaturan AT"

msgid "This option deletes all SMS messages, including ones not visible on the Inbox tab"
msgstr "Opsi ini menghapus semua pesan SMS, termasuk yang tidak terlihat di tab Kotak masuk"

msgid "Select 'No' if the router has a single LED or the LED serves several purposes. This option needs an LED defined in the system to work reliably when the LED is shared."
msgstr "Pilih 'Tidak' jika router hanya memiliki satu LED atau LED digunakan untuk beberapa keperluan. Opsi ini memerlukan LED yang terdefinisi di sistem agar bekerja andal saat LED dipakai bersama."

msgid "The phone number should start with the country prefix (for example 7 for Russia, without the '+'). Numbers of 3, 4 or 5 digits are treated as 'short' and must not get a country prefix."
msgstr "Nomor telepon harus diawali prefiks negara (misalnya 7 untuk Rusia, tanpa '+'). Nomor 3, 4, atau 5 digit dianggap 'pendek' dan tidak boleh diberi prefiks negara."

msgid "Each line must use the format 'Contact name;phone number'. The file is saved to <code>/etc/5gmodem/modem/phonebook.user</code>."
msgstr "Setiap baris harus menggunakan format 'Nama kontak;nomor telepon'. File disimpan ke <code>/etc/5gmodem/modem/phonebook.user</code>."

msgid "Each line must use the format 'Code description;code'. The file is saved to <code>/etc/5gmodem/modem/ussdcodes/</code>."
msgstr "Setiap baris harus menggunakan format 'Deskripsi kode;kode'. File disimpan ke <code>/etc/5gmodem/modem/ussdcodes/</code>."

msgid "Each line must use the format 'AT command description;AT command'. The file is saved to <code>/etc/5gmodem/modem/atcmmds/</code>."
msgstr "Setiap baris harus menggunakan format 'Deskripsi perintah AT;perintah AT'. File disimpan ke <code>/etc/5gmodem/modem/atcmmds/</code>."

msgid "TTL fixing"
msgstr "Perbaikan TTL"

msgid "Hop Limit IPv6 (in / out)"
msgstr "Hop Limit IPv6 (masuk / keluar)"

msgid "Inbox"
msgstr "Kotak masuk"

msgid "Send SMS"
msgstr "Kirim SMS"

msgid "Restart modem"
msgstr "Mulai ulang modem"

msgid "Restart the modem (AT+CFUN=1,1)"
msgstr "Mulai ulang modem (AT+CFUN=1,1)"

msgid "Restart the modem now? The connection will drop for a while."
msgstr "Mulai ulang modem sekarang? Koneksi akan terputus sementara."

msgid "Restarting the modem..."
msgstr "Memulai ulang modem..."

msgid "Modem AT port not found"
msgstr "Port AT modem tidak ditemukan"

msgid "The modem is restarting. This can take a minute."
msgstr "Modem sedang dimulai ulang. Ini dapat memakan waktu satu menit."

msgid "Failed to restart the modem"
msgstr "Gagal memulai ulang modem"

msgid "Waiting for the modem to connect…"
msgstr "Menunggu modem terhubung…"

msgid "View the tower on the 4cells.ru map"
msgstr "Lihat menara di peta 4cells.ru"

msgid "Modem interface"
msgstr "Antarmuka modem"

msgid "Create a network interface for the modem automatically (the control protocol is detected). If it already exists, it is just brought up."
msgstr "Buat antarmuka jaringan untuk modem secara otomatis (protokol kontrol dideteksi). Jika sudah ada, antarmuka hanya diaktifkan."

msgid "Create modem interface"
msgstr "Buat antarmuka modem"

msgid "Creating the modem interface..."
msgstr "Membuat antarmuka modem..."

msgid "Interface \"%s\" created (%s), bringing it up…"
msgstr "Antarmuka \"%s\" dibuat (%s), mengaktifkannya…"

