msgid "Such a modem normally exposes only its web interface: no TAC, no band, no EARFCN, no USSD. In this mode it also shows serial ports and is driven like any other modem, keeping its network card and internet. The mode is reset when the modem reboots, so it is applied again every time the modem appears."
msgstr "Modem seperti ini biasanya hanya menyediakan antarmuka web: tanpa TAC, pita frekuensi, EARFCN, maupun USSD. Dalam mode ini modem juga menampilkan port serial dan dikendalikan seperti modem lain, tetap mempertahankan kartu jaringan dan internetnya. Mode direset saat modem dimulai ulang, jadi diterapkan lagi setiap kali modem muncul."

msgid "Switch the modem into the mode with AT ports: TAC, bands, EARFCN, USSD and the AT console become available. The mode resets when the modem reboots."
msgstr "Alihkan modem ke mode dengan port AT: TAC, pita frekuensi, EARFCN, USSD, dan konsol AT menjadi tersedia. Mode direset saat modem dimulai ulang."

