msgid "Endpoint that accepts a POST body, for the upload test. RU-hosted endpoints (Rostelecom/Yandex) work over Russian cellular; the server reads the body even when it answers 404/403, so the speed is still measured."
msgstr "Endpoint yang menerima body POST, untuk uji unggah. Endpoint yang di-host di RU (Rostelecom/Yandex) berfungsi melalui seluler Rusia; server membaca body meskipun menjawab 404/403, sehingga kecepatan tetap terukur."

msgid "Endpoint that accepts a POST body, for the upload test. \"Internetometer\" uses a node from the same probe list as the download source, and can be picked here on its own. RU-hosted endpoints (Rostelecom/Yandex) work over Russian cellular; the server reads the body even when it answers 404/403, so the speed is still measured."
msgstr "Endpoint yang menerima body POST, untuk uji unggah. \"Internetometer\" memakai node dari daftar pemeriksaan yang sama dengan sumber unduh, dan dapat dipilih tersendiri di sini. Endpoint yang di-host di RU (Rostelecom/Yandex) berfungsi melalui seluler Rusia; server membaca body meskipun menjawab 404/403, sehingga kecepatan tetap terukur."

