msgstr "Baru"

msgid "USSD works over the circuit-switched channel. If the modem is registered in LTE only, switch it to 3G on the frequency-management page and repeat the request."
msgstr "USSD bekerja melalui kanal circuit-switched. Jika modem terdaftar hanya di LTE, alihkan ke 3G di halaman pengelolaan frekuensi lalu ulangi permintaan."

msgid "The modem is registered in %s now, and USSD runs over the circuit-switched channel. The request will therefore switch the modem to 3G and switch it back on its own - the connection drops for about twenty seconds."
msgstr "Modem saat ini terdaftar di %s, sedangkan USSD berjalan melalui kanal circuit-switched. Karena itu permintaan akan mengalihkan modem ke 3G dan mengembalikannya secara otomatis - koneksi terputus sekitar dua puluh detik."

msgid "Switching the modem to 3G - USSD needs the circuit-switched channel"
msgstr "Mengalihkan modem ke 3G - USSD memerlukan kanal circuit-switched"

msgid "Sending the request"
msgstr "Mengirim permintaan"

msgid "Restoring the previous network mode"
msgstr "Memulihkan mode jaringan sebelumnya"

msgid "Could not switch the modem to 3G, so the request was not sent: USSD needs the circuit-switched channel."
msgstr "Tidak dapat mengalihkan modem ke 3G, sehingga permintaan tidak dikirim: USSD memerlukan kanal circuit-switched."

msgid "This modem does not answer USSD requests: its firmware has no SS support. Verified on real hardware."
msgstr "Modem ini tidak menjawab permintaan USSD: firmware-nya tidak mendukung SS. Telah diverifikasi pada perangkat nyata."

msgid "No reply. The request went to a modem that is not the active one, so it was not switched to 3G - and USSD needs the circuit-switched channel. Select this modem and repeat."
msgstr "Tidak ada balasan. Permintaan dikirim ke modem yang bukan modem aktif, sehingga tidak dialihkan ke 3G - padahal USSD memerlukan kanal circuit-switched. Pilih modem ini lalu ulangi."

msgid "Switch the modem to 3G for USSD"
msgstr "Alihkan modem ke 3G untuk USSD"

msgid "USSD runs over the circuit-switched channel, which LTE does not have. Some modems handle this themselves; others answer nothing until the modem is actually in 3G. With this option the request switches the modem to 3G and switches it back - about twenty seconds without a connection. It is enabled automatically for modems already known to need it."
msgstr "USSD berjalan melalui kanal circuit-switched, yang tidak dimiliki LTE. Beberapa modem menanganinya sendiri; yang lain tidak menjawab sampai modem benar-benar berada di 3G. Dengan opsi ini, permintaan akan mengalihkan modem ke 3G lalu mengembalikannya - sekitar dua puluh detik tanpa koneksi. Opsi ini aktif otomatis untuk modem yang sudah diketahui memerlukannya."

msgid "The modem is registered in %s now, and USSD runs over the circuit-switched channel. The request will therefore switch the modem to 3G and switch it back - the connection drops for about twenty seconds."
msgstr "Modem saat ini terdaftar di %s, sedangkan USSD berjalan melalui kanal circuit-switched. Karena itu permintaan akan mengalihkan modem ke 3G lalu mengembalikannya - koneksi terputus sekitar dua puluh detik."

msgid "The modem is registered in %s now, and USSD runs over the circuit-switched channel, which LTE does not have. Many modems still answer; if this one stays silent, enable \"Switch the modem to 3G for USSD\" in the settings below."
msgstr "Modem saat ini terdaftar di %s, sedangkan USSD berjalan melalui kanal circuit-switched yang tidak dimiliki LTE. Banyak modem tetap menjawab; jika modem ini diam, aktifkan \"Alihkan modem ke 3G untuk USSD\" di pengaturan di bawah."

msgid "Data has not been updated for %d s (shown from the last snapshot)"
msgstr "Data tidak diperbarui selama %d dtk (ditampilkan dari snapshot terakhir)"

msgid "Data has not been updated for %d min (shown from the last snapshot)"
msgstr "Data tidak diperbarui selama %d mnt (ditampilkan dari snapshot terakhir)"

msgid "This modem is managed by ModemManager, and its control channel belongs to MM. Opening a second eSIM session on the same channel can crash the modem firmware (seen live on T99W175 - the modem reboots). To manage eSIM, enable \"Hide from ModemManager\" in the modem settings (or switch the interface protocol), then come back here."
msgstr "Modem ini dikelola oleh ModemManager, dan kanal kendalinya milik MM. Membuka sesi eSIM kedua pada kanal yang sama dapat membuat firmware modem crash (terlihat langsung pada T99W175 - modem memulai ulang). Untuk mengelola eSIM, aktifkan \"Sembunyikan dari ModemManager\" di pengaturan modem (atau ganti protokol antarmuka), lalu kembali ke sini."

msgid "Internet is working (%s ms)"
msgstr "Internet berfungsi (%s ms)"

msgid "No internet on this link"
msgstr "Tidak ada internet di tautan ini"

msgid "Checking…"
msgstr "Memeriksa…"

msgid "Internet watchdog settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan pengawas koneksi"

msgid "Internet watchdog"
msgstr "Pengawas koneksi"

msgid "Pings each uplink through its own device. A link is marked down after several consecutive failures and up again after several successes, so single lost packets do not flip the state. Health lamps are shown on the cards; traffic switching is optional and enabled below."
msgstr "Melakukan ping ke setiap uplink melalui perangkatnya sendiri. Tautan ditandai mati setelah beberapa kegagalan berturut-turut dan hidup kembali setelah beberapa keberhasilan, sehingga paket yang hilang sesekali tidak membalik status. Lampu kesehatan ditampilkan pada kartu; pengalihan lalu lintas bersifat opsional dan diaktifkan di bawah."

msgid "Enable watching"
msgstr "Aktifkan pengawasan"

msgid "Check interval, s"
msgstr "Interval pemeriksaan, dtk"

msgid "Ping targets (comma-separated)"
msgstr "Target ping (dipisahkan koma)"

msgid "Failures before down"
msgstr "Kegagalan sebelum mati"

msgid "Successes before up"
msgstr "Keberhasilan sebelum hidup"

msgid "Switch traffic to a backup link when one goes down"
msgstr "Alihkan lalu lintas ke tautan cadangan saat salah satunya mati"

msgid "A link that has an address but no internet will not give the traffic up on its own - the watchdog moves the route past it, and brings it back when the link recovers. Route metrics in the settings stay untouched. On by default."
msgstr "Tautan yang punya alamat tetapi tanpa internet tidak akan melepaskan lalu lintas dengan sendirinya - pengawas koneksi memindahkan rute melewatinya, dan mengembalikannya saat tautan pulih. Metrik rute di pengaturan tidak diubah. Aktif secara bawaan."

msgid "Traffic goes through %s, and there is no internet on it. Automatic switching is off - the watchdog sees the failure and does nothing."
msgstr "Lalu lintas melewati %s, dan tidak ada internet di sana. Pengalihan otomatis nonaktif - pengawas koneksi melihat kegagalan tetapi tidak berbuat apa-apa."

msgid "Turn switching on"
msgstr "Aktifkan pengalihan"

msgid "Heal a modem while its link is down"
msgstr "Pulihkan modem saat tautannya mati"

msgid "Steps are tried from mild to strong, at most once per 5 minutes, 6 attempts total; the ladder resets when the link recovers."
msgstr "Langkah dicoba dari yang ringan ke yang kuat, paling sering sekali per 5 menit, total 6 percobaan; urutan diatur ulang saat tautan pulih."

msgid "Do nothing"
msgstr "Jangan lakukan apa pun"

msgid "Reconnect the interface"
msgstr "Sambungkan ulang antarmuka"

msgid "...plus reboot the module"
msgstr "...ditambah mulai ulang modul"

msgid "...plus USB power cycle"
msgstr "...ditambah mati-nyalakan daya USB"

msgid "When a link recovers"
msgstr "Saat tautan pulih"

msgid "Return its priority"
msgstr "Kembalikan prioritasnya"

msgid "Keep it last"
msgstr "Tetap di urutan terakhir"

msgid "Reconnecting"
msgstr "Menyambung ulang"

msgid "Rebooting the module"
msgstr "Memulai ulang modul"

msgid "USB power cycle"
msgstr "Mati-nyalakan daya USB"

msgid "Device is gone"
msgstr "Perangkat hilang"

msgid "sec"
msgstr "dtk"

msgid "Rebooting"
msgstr "Memulai ulang"

msgid "Ping targets"
msgstr "Target ping"

msgid "Also heal the Wi-Fi uplink"
msgstr "Pulihkan juga uplink Wi-Fi"

