msgstr "Data deret disimpan di RAM dan hilang saat dimulai ulang."

msgid "Keep monthly traffic across reboots"
msgstr "Simpan lalu lintas bulanan setelah mulai ulang"

msgid "Monthly totals are written to flash about once an hour. Ping series are never written there."
msgstr "Total bulanan ditulis ke flash sekitar sekali per jam. Data deret ping tidak pernah ditulis ke sana."

msgid "Reset statistics"
msgstr "Atur ulang statistik"

msgid "Uplink latency"
msgstr "Latensi uplink"

