msgid "Active carrier: this band is carrying your data right now"
msgstr "Carrier aktif: pita frekuensi ini sedang membawa data Anda saat ini"

msgid "Standby carrier: the network has assembled this band into the aggregation but it is idle now - it activates when traffic grows"
msgstr "Carrier siaga: jaringan telah memasukkan pita frekuensi ini ke dalam agregasi tetapi saat ini diam - akan aktif saat lalu lintas meningkat"

msgid "Enter the number as is: a 10-digit national number gets the country prefix from the settings automatically; short service numbers (like 000100) are sent unchanged."
msgstr "Masukkan nomor apa adanya: nomor nasional 10 digit otomatis mendapat awalan negara dari pengaturan; nomor layanan pendek (seperti 000100) dikirim tanpa perubahan."

msgid "e.g. 9291067196 or a short number like 000100"
msgstr "mis. 9291067196 atau nomor pendek seperti 000100"

msgid "A link marked here never receives traffic automatically - to use it, make it first by clicking its card. Handy for a backup like Wi-Fi to your phone."
msgstr "Tautan yang ditandai di sini tidak pernah menerima lalu lintas secara otomatis - untuk menggunakannya, jadikan yang pertama dengan mengklik kartunya. Berguna untuk cadangan seperti Wi-Fi ke ponsel Anda."

msgid "Use only manually"
msgstr "Gunakan hanya secara manual"

msgid "Transmission rank: the network is sending %d parallel data streams right now"
msgstr "Peringkat transmisi: jaringan saat ini mengirim %d aliran data paralel"

msgid "Receive chains: %d of %d antenna ports hear the network (details in the Antenna ports table)"
msgstr "Rantai penerima: %d dari %d port antena menangkap jaringan (detail di tabel Port antena)"

msgid "backend said \"%s\" for protocol \"%s\""
msgstr "backend menjawab \"%s\" untuk protokol \"%s\""

msgid "empty backend reply"
msgstr "balasan backend kosong"

msgid "Details are in the system log (logread, tag 5gmodem)."
msgstr "Detail ada di log sistem (logread, tag 5gmodem)."

msgid "Both reading and receiving: the modem is told to put new incoming messages here as well. A modem that cannot receive into the chosen storage keeps its own, and this setting is corrected to match - the list always shows the box the messages actually land in. SIM cards hold only two or three dozen messages - once full, the operator stops delivering. Until you pick a value here, the app selects the larger storage of the two on its own."
msgstr "Untuk membaca dan menerima: modem diminta menyimpan pesan masuk baru di sini juga. Modem yang tidak dapat menerima ke penyimpanan yang dipilih tetap memakai miliknya sendiri, dan pengaturan ini dikoreksi agar sesuai - daftar selalu menampilkan kotak tempat pesan benar-benar masuk. Kartu SIM hanya menampung dua atau tiga lusin pesan - setelah penuh, operator berhenti mengirim. Hingga Anda memilih nilai di sini, aplikasi memilih sendiri penyimpanan yang lebih besar dari keduanya."

msgid "Restart on uplink"
msgstr "Mulai ulang saat uplink aktif"

msgid "Restart the service once the uplink starts carrying traffic."
msgstr "Mulai ulang layanan setelah uplink mulai membawa lalu lintas."

msgid "Keep messages in router memory"
msgstr "Simpan pesan di memori router"

msgid "Copy incoming messages to the router and show them from there. Modem storage is tiny - some modems have no memory of their own at all and can only use the SIM card, where a couple of dozen slots fill up and the operator stops delivering. Messages are kept on flash and survive a reboot."
msgstr "Salin pesan masuk ke router dan tampilkan dari sana. Penyimpanan modem sangat kecil - beberapa modem sama sekali tidak memiliki memori sendiri dan hanya dapat menggunakan kartu SIM, yang beberapa lusin slotnya cepat penuh dan operator berhenti mengirim. Pesan disimpan di flash dan bertahan setelah mulai ulang."

msgid "Free modem slots"
msgstr "Kosongkan slot modem"

msgid "Delete a message from the modem once it is in the router memory. This is what removes the limit. A message is only deleted after it has been stored AND, if enabled, forwarded to Telegram and offered to the SMS commands - so nothing is lost when the network is down."
msgstr "Hapus pesan dari modem setelah tersimpan di memori router. Inilah yang menghilangkan batasnya. Pesan hanya dihapus setelah disimpan DAN, jika diaktifkan, diteruskan ke Telegram dan diberikan ke perintah SMS - jadi tidak ada yang hilang saat jaringan terputus."

msgid "Keep at most"
msgstr "Simpan paling banyak"

msgid "Older messages are dropped when the limit is reached."
msgstr "Pesan lama dibuang saat batas tercapai."

msgid "%s messages"
msgstr "%s pesan"

msgid "Run commands from SMS"
msgstr "Jalankan perintah dari SMS"

msgid "Execute a configured command when a message starts with its keyword. Useful when the router is unreachable over the network - SMS still gets through. The message text is never pasted into the command line: whatever follows the keyword is passed as the SMS_ARGS environment variable."
msgstr "Jalankan perintah yang dikonfigurasi saat pesan diawali kata kuncinya. Berguna saat router tidak dapat dijangkau melalui jaringan - SMS tetap sampai. Teks pesan tidak pernah disisipkan ke baris perintah: apa pun setelah kata kunci diteruskan sebagai variabel lingkungan SMS_ARGS."

msgid "Trusted numbers only"
msgstr "Hanya nomor tepercaya"

msgid "Run commands only from the numbers listed below. With this on and the list empty, nothing runs at all. Turning it off lets anyone who knows the SIM number run your commands."
msgstr "Jalankan perintah hanya dari nomor yang tercantum di bawah. Jika ini aktif dan daftar kosong, tidak ada yang dijalankan sama sekali. Menonaktifkannya memungkinkan siapa pun yang mengetahui nomor SIM menjalankan perintah Anda."

msgid "Trusted numbers"
msgstr "Nomor tepercaya"

msgid "Compared by the last ten digits, so +7…, 8… and 7… are the same number."
msgstr "Dibandingkan berdasarkan sepuluh digit terakhir, sehingga +7…, 8… dan 7… dianggap nomor yang sama."

msgid "Keyword"
msgstr "Kata kunci"

msgid "First word of the message, case-insensitive"
msgstr "Kata pertama pesan, tidak membedakan huruf besar/kecil"

msgid "Command"
msgstr "Perintah"

msgid "Shell command to run"
msgstr "Perintah shell yang dijalankan"

msgid "Send the command output back to the sender"
msgstr "Kirim keluaran perintah kembali ke pengirim"

msgid "Reply text"
msgstr "Teks balasan"

msgid "Sent before the output; on its own when a delay is set"
msgstr "Dikirim sebelum keluaran; dikirim sendiri jika penundaan diatur"

msgid "Delay, s"
msgstr "Penundaan, dtk"

msgid "Wait before running. With a delay the reply is sent FIRST - that is the only way a command like reboot can answer at all."
msgstr "Tunggu sebelum menjalankan. Dengan penundaan, balasan dikirim LEBIH DULU - hanya dengan cara itu perintah seperti reboot dapat menjawab."

msgid "The keyword is the first word of the message, case-insensitive; the rest is passed to the command as SMS_ARGS. With a delay the reply is sent FIRST - that is the only way a command like reboot can answer at all."
msgstr "Kata kunci adalah kata pertama pesan, tidak membedakan huruf besar/kecil; sisanya diteruskan ke perintah sebagai SMS_ARGS. Dengan penundaan, balasan dikirim LEBIH DULU - hanya dengan cara itu perintah seperti reboot dapat menjawab."

msgid "What counts as a modem"
msgstr "Apa yang dianggap modem"

msgid "USB devices with ports that the app found. Uncheck the ones that are not modems — a USB-to-serial adapter, for example — and they lose their tab and stop being probed with AT commands."
msgstr "Perangkat USB dengan port yang ditemukan aplikasi. Hapus centang yang bukan modem — misalnya adaptor USB-ke-serial — maka tab-nya hilang dan tidak lagi diperiksa dengan perintah AT."

msgid "not on the bus"
msgstr "tidak ada di bus"

msgid "A shell command, exactly as you would type it over SSH."
msgstr "Perintah shell, persis seperti yang Anda ketik melalui SSH."

msgid "CDC Ethernet interface"
msgstr "Antarmuka CDC Ethernet"

msgid "CDC NCM interface"
msgstr "Antarmuka CDC NCM"

msgid "cellular module vendor"
msgstr "vendor modul seluler"

msgid "empty - no code"
msgstr "kosong - tanpa kode"

msgid "Every USB device the app found with ports of its own. Checked ones are treated as modems; the app decides that by the drivers the kernel bound to the device, so an adapter or a printer stays out. Check a device to force it in, uncheck one to make it lose its tab and stop being probed with AT commands."
msgstr "Setiap perangkat USB yang ditemukan aplikasi dengan port sendiri. Yang dicentang diperlakukan sebagai modem; aplikasi menentukannya dari driver yang diikat kernel ke perangkat, sehingga adaptor atau printer tidak ikut. Centang perangkat untuk memaksanya masuk, hapus centang agar tab-nya hilang dan tidak lagi diperiksa dengan perintah AT."

msgid "excluded by hand"
msgstr "dikecualikan secara manual"

msgid "has answered as a modem before"
msgstr "pernah merespons sebagai modem"

msgid "The FIRST word of the message, before the command word: \"%s\" runs the command named \"reboot\" below. Change it to a word only you know - the default is the same for everyone. Empty means no code at all, and then the only protection is the list of trusted numbers - a sender number can be forged."
msgstr "Kata PERTAMA pesan, sebelum kata perintah: \"%s\" menjalankan perintah bernama \"reboot\" di bawah. Ganti dengan kata yang hanya Anda ketahui - bawaannya sama untuk semua orang. Kosong berarti tanpa kode sama sekali, sehingga satu-satunya perlindungan adalah daftar nomor tepercaya - nomor pengirim dapat dipalsukan."

msgid "marked as a modem by hand"
msgstr "ditandai sebagai modem secara manual"

msgid "MBIM interface"
msgstr "Antarmuka MBIM"

msgid "modem driver in the kernel"
msgstr "driver modem di kernel"

msgid "no modem driver and no modem network interface"
msgstr "tidak ada driver modem dan tidak ada antarmuka jaringan modem"

msgid "Security code"
msgstr "Kode keamanan"

msgid "Send the word from the first column in an SMS - the router runs what is in the second. The word is matched without case, anything after it reaches the command as SMS_ARGS. A command that kills the connection (reboot, modem power cycle) needs a delay: the reply is then sent BEFORE the command runs, which is the only way it can be sent at all."
msgstr "Kirim kata dari kolom pertama melalui SMS - router menjalankan isi kolom kedua. Kata dicocokkan tanpa membedakan huruf besar/kecil, apa pun setelahnya diteruskan ke perintah sebagai SMS_ARGS. Perintah yang memutus koneksi (reboot, mati-nyalakan daya modem) memerlukan penundaan: balasan kemudian dikirim SEBELUM perintah dijalankan, hanya dengan cara itu balasan dapat terkirim."

msgid "USB-to-serial adapter"
msgstr "Adaptor USB-ke-serial"

msgid "modem in a flashing or boot mode"
msgstr "modem dalam mode flashing atau boot"

msgid "What to run"
msgstr "Yang dijalankan"

msgid "Word in the SMS"
msgstr "Kata dalam SMS"

msgid "Send an SMS that starts with the word of a command below - the router runs it. Useful when the router is unreachable over the network: SMS still gets through. The message text is never pasted into the command line, whatever follows the word is passed as the SMS_ARGS environment variable."
msgstr "Kirim SMS yang diawali kata dari salah satu perintah di bawah - router akan menjalankannya. Berguna saat router tidak dapat dijangkau melalui jaringan: SMS tetap sampai. Teks pesan tidak pernah disisipkan ke baris perintah, apa pun setelah kata tersebut diteruskan sebagai variabel lingkungan SMS_ARGS."

msgid "Reassociating"
msgstr "Mengasosiasikan ulang"

msgid "Restarting the radio"
msgstr "Memulai ulang radio"

msgid "Rebuilding the network"
msgstr "Membangun ulang jaringan"

msgid "modem web API"
msgstr "API web modem"

msgid "%ds"
msgstr "%d dtk"

msgid "%dm"
msgstr "%dm"

msgid "Device blacklist"
msgstr "Daftar hitam perangkat"

msgid "USB devices the app is not sure about - they are missing from its modem database. Tick one to drop it from the app: no tab, no AT probing, no place in internet priority. Applied immediately."
msgstr "Perangkat USB yang tidak dikenali pasti oleh aplikasi - tidak ada di basis data modemnya. Centang untuk mengeluarkannya dari aplikasi: tanpa tab, tanpa pemeriksaan AT, tanpa tempat di prioritas internet. Diterapkan segera."

msgid "No doubtful devices: everything found on the bus is in the modem database."
msgstr "Tidak ada perangkat meragukan: semua yang ditemukan di bus ada di basis data modem."

msgid "returned to modems by hand"
msgstr "dikembalikan ke modem secara manual"

msgid "none"
msgstr "tidak ada"

msgid "%s - receive only, works only as an aggregation carrier"
msgstr "%s - hanya penerimaan, hanya berfungsi sebagai carrier agregasi"

msgid "%s is running"
msgstr "%s sedang berjalan"

msgid "%s is stopped"
msgstr "%s dihentikan"

msgid "(#%d)"
msgstr "(#%d)"

msgid "APN profile index"
msgstr "Indeks profil APN"

msgid "Applying bands — the connection will briefly drop, then reconnect."
msgstr "Menerapkan pita frekuensi — koneksi akan terputus sebentar, lalu tersambung kembali."

msgid "Authentication Type"
msgstr "Jenis autentikasi"

msgid "Cell EARFCN/PCI unknown yet - try again in a few seconds"
msgstr "EARFCN/PCI sel belum diketahui - coba lagi dalam beberapa detik"

msgid "Change bands"
msgstr "Ubah pita frekuensi"

msgid "Changing bands briefly interrupts the connection: the app hands the modem to ModemManager, applies the change and reconnects (up to a minute)."
msgstr "Mengubah pita frekuensi memutus koneksi sebentar: aplikasi menyerahkan modem ke ModemManager, menerapkan perubahan, dan menyambung ulang (hingga satu menit)."

msgid "Checking this option will make it easier to read the messages, but it will cause a discrepancy in the number of messages shown and received"
msgstr "Mencentang opsi ini akan memudahkan membaca pesan, tetapi akan menyebabkan selisih antara jumlah pesan yang ditampilkan dan yang diterima"

msgid "Could not read messages"
msgstr "Tidak dapat membaca pesan"

msgid "Ec/No"
msgstr "Ec/No"

msgid "IPv6 APN"
msgstr "APN IPv6"

msgid "IPv6 APN profile index"
msgstr "Indeks profil APN IPv6"

msgid "If unchecked, no default route is configured"
msgstr "Jika tidak dicentang, rute bawaan tidak dikonfigurasi"

msgid "If unchecked, the advertised DNS server addresses are ignored"
msgstr "Jika tidak dicentang, alamat server DNS yang diiklankan diabaikan"

msgid "Lock to this cell (EARFCN %s, PCI %s)"
msgstr "Kunci ke sel ini (EARFCN %s, PCI %s)"

msgid "MBIM"
msgstr "MBIM"

msgid "Maximum amount of seconds to wait for the modem to become ready"
msgstr "Jumlah detik maksimum menunggu modem siap"

msgid "Modem device"
msgstr "Perangkat modem"

msgid "Modem init timeout"
msgstr "Batas waktu inisialisasi modem"

msgid "ModemManager"
msgstr "ModemManager"

msgid "Override MTU"
msgstr "Timpa MTU"

msgid "PDP Type"
msgstr "Jenis PDP"

msgid "PIN"
msgstr "PIN"

msgid "RSCP"
msgstr "RSCP"

msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Atur ulang"

msgid "This option allows to backup SMS messages or, for example, save messages that are not supported by the sms-tool"
msgstr "Opsi ini memungkinkan pencadangan pesan SMS atau, misalnya, menyimpan pesan yang tidak didukung oleh sms-tool"

msgid "To change bands the app briefly hands this modem to ModemManager, applies the change and reconnects. The connection will drop for up to a minute."
msgstr "Untuk mengubah pita frekuensi, aplikasi menyerahkan modem ini ke ModemManager sebentar, menerapkan perubahan, dan menyambung ulang. Koneksi akan terputus hingga satu menit."

msgid "USB vendor and product ID"
msgstr "ID vendor dan produk USB"

msgid "Use DNS servers advertised by peer"
msgstr "Gunakan server DNS yang diiklankan peer"

msgid "Use default gateway"
msgstr "Gunakan gateway bawaan"

msgid "Use gateway metric"
msgstr "Gunakan metrik gateway"

msgid "Check now"
msgstr "Periksa sekarang"

msgid "Every minute"
msgstr "Setiap menit"

msgid "Every 5 minutes"
msgstr "Setiap 5 menit"

msgid "Every 15 minutes"
msgstr "Setiap 15 menit"

msgid "Every 30 minutes"
msgstr "Setiap 30 menit"

msgid "External IP"
msgstr "IP eksternal"

msgid "External address as seen from the internet%s"
msgstr "Alamat eksternal sebagaimana terlihat dari internet%s"

msgid "External address via %s. Interface address: %s"
msgstr "Alamat eksternal melalui %s. Alamat antarmuka: %s"

msgid "Header sent with the request. Some services answer a console client with plain text and a browser with an HTML page; and a header of your own keeps the router from introducing itself as one. Empty - whatever curl/wget sends by default."
msgstr "Header yang dikirim bersama permintaan. Beberapa layanan menjawab klien konsol dengan teks biasa dan browser dengan halaman HTML; header Anda sendiri juga mencegah router memperkenalkan dirinya sebagai router. Kosong - apa pun yang dikirim curl/wget secara bawaan."

msgid "How often the address is looked up again. A change of uplink refreshes it immediately, without waiting for the interval."
msgstr "Seberapa sering alamat diperiksa ulang. Pergantian uplink langsung memperbaruinya, tanpa menunggu interval."

msgid "IPv4 service"
msgstr "Layanan IPv4"

msgid "IPv6 service"
msgstr "Layanan IPv6"

msgid "On the card of the uplink that currently carries the traffic, show the external address instead of the one assigned by the carrier."
msgstr "Pada kartu uplink yang sedang membawa lalu lintas, tampilkan alamat eksternal alih-alih alamat yang diberikan operator."

msgid "Only this service is queried - there are no silent fallbacks. One that also returns the country (like ip-api.com) gets a flag shown next to the address. Foreign services often stay silent over Russian cellular; the Yandex one answers there."
msgstr "Hanya layanan ini yang ditanyai - tidak ada cadangan diam-diam. Layanan yang juga mengembalikan negara (seperti ip-api.com) akan menampilkan bendera di samping alamat. Layanan asing sering tidak menjawab melalui jaringan seluler Rusia; layanan Yandex menjawab di sana."

msgid "Queried only when the router actually has an IPv6 default route - otherwise the request would just sit there until it times out."
msgstr "Ditanyai hanya jika router benar-benar memiliki rute bawaan IPv6 - jika tidak, permintaan hanya akan menggantung hingga waktu habis."

msgid "Query the services above with the current settings and show what they answer."
msgstr "Tanyai layanan di atas dengan pengaturan saat ini dan tampilkan jawabannya."

msgid "Refresh interval"
msgstr "Interval penyegaran"

msgid "Show in the priority bar"
msgstr "Tampilkan di bilah prioritas"

msgid "Show the address the internet sees (extIPv4/extIPv6) next to the one the carrier assigned. Behind CGNAT or a tunnel the two differ - and that difference tells you whether the router's own traffic goes through the VPN. Off by default: this is a request to a third-party service."
msgstr "Tampilkan alamat yang terlihat oleh internet (extIPv4/extIPv6) di samping alamat yang diberikan operator. Di balik CGNAT atau tunnel keduanya berbeda - dan perbedaan itu menunjukkan apakah lalu lintas router sendiri melewati VPN. Nonaktif secara bawaan: ini adalah permintaan ke layanan pihak ketiga."

msgid "User-Agent"
msgstr "User-Agent"

msgid "country"
msgstr "negara"

msgid "no answer from %s"
msgstr "tidak ada jawaban dari %s"

msgid "public demo"
msgstr "demo publik"

msgid "Create interface (USB tethering)"
msgstr "Buat antarmuka (USB tethering)"

msgid "Recreate interface (USB tethering)"
msgstr "Buat ulang antarmuka (USB tethering)"

msgid "This phone shares the internet over USB and hands out an address over DHCP. The button creates (or recreates) that DHCP interface - there is no dial-up protocol to choose, and no modem metrics to read."
msgstr "Ponsel ini membagikan internet melalui USB dan memberikan alamat melalui DHCP. Tombol ini membuat (atau membuat ulang) antarmuka DHCP tersebut - tidak ada protokol dial-up yang perlu dipilih, dan tidak ada metrik modem untuk dibaca."

msgid "works over cellular"
msgstr "berfungsi melalui seluler"

msgid "Shared with \"External IP\" - set it under \"For experts\""
msgstr "Dipakai bersama dengan \"IP eksternal\" - atur di bawah \"Untuk ahli\""

msgid "Show the external address"
msgstr "Tampilkan alamat eksternal"

msgid "Show it next to the address the carrier assigned - in the modem card as \"IPv4: 10.x.x.x | 1.2.3.4\". Behind CGNAT or a tunnel the two differ, and that difference tells you whether the router's own traffic goes through the VPN. Off by default: this is a request to a third-party service."
msgstr "Tampilkan di samping alamat yang diberikan operator - di kartu modem sebagai \"IPv4: 10.x.x.x | 1.2.3.4\". Di balik CGNAT atau tunnel keduanya berbeda, dan perbedaan itu menunjukkan apakah lalu lintas router sendiri melewati VPN. Nonaktif secara bawaan: ini adalah permintaan ke layanan pihak ketiga."

msgid "Used only when the service above returns an address but no country: the flag is then resolved by a second request, for the country alone. Use {ip} as the address placeholder."
msgstr "Hanya digunakan jika layanan di atas mengembalikan alamat tanpa negara: bendera kemudian ditentukan lewat permintaan kedua, khusus untuk negara. Gunakan {ip} sebagai placeholder alamat."

msgid "Where the router asks what its address looks like from the outside. The speed-test card uses the same service."
msgstr "Tempat router menanyakan seperti apa alamatnya dilihat dari luar. Kartu uji kecepatan menggunakan layanan yang sama."

msgid "The address is public: the interface has exactly what the internet sees%s"
msgstr "Alamat ini publik: antarmuka memiliki alamat yang persis sama dengan yang dilihat internet%s"

msgid "What the modem itself can do. Not the speed of the current connection."
msgstr "Kemampuan modem itu sendiri. Bukan kecepatan koneksi saat ini."

msgid "Max speed"
msgstr "Kecepatan maks."

msgid "Open the %s admin panel in a new tab"
msgstr "Buka panel admin %s di tab baru"

msgid "AT polling under ModemManager"
msgstr "Polling AT di bawah ModemManager"

msgid "Read temperature, carrier aggregation and other vendor metrics over the AT port while ModemManager drives the modem. Off by default for firmware known to drop the data session on a parallel AT exchange (Dell DW5821e / Foxconn T77W968); other modems are polled only while the session is up. A DW5821e with two AT ports does not need this switch: after a reboot its second port is kept away from ModemManager and polled automatically. Enable only if the link stays stable with the page open."
msgstr "Baca suhu, agregasi carrier, dan metrik vendor lainnya melalui port AT saat ModemManager mengendalikan modem. Nonaktif secara bawaan untuk firmware yang diketahui memutus sesi data saat ada pertukaran AT paralel (Dell DW5821e / Foxconn T77W968); modem lain hanya di-polling saat sesi aktif. DW5821e dengan dua port AT tidak memerlukan sakelar ini: setelah dimulai ulang, port keduanya dijauhkan dari ModemManager dan di-polling otomatis. Aktifkan hanya jika koneksi tetap stabil saat halaman terbuka."

msgid "Failed to read modem data"
msgstr "Gagal membaca data modem"

msgid "The modem port is busy, try again in a few seconds"
msgstr "Port modem sedang sibuk, coba lagi dalam beberapa detik"

msgid "The modem AT port is busy, try again"
msgstr "Port AT modem sedang sibuk, coba lagi"

msgid "AT polling under ModemManager is off for this firmware (it drops the data session), so the current band selection is not read. Applying bands and mode still works; to see the current selection, enable \"AT polling under ModemManager\" in the modem settings."
msgstr "Polling AT di bawah ModemManager dinonaktifkan untuk firmware ini (memutus sesi data), sehingga pilihan pita frekuensi saat ini tidak terbaca. Menerapkan pita dan mode tetap berfungsi; untuk melihat pilihan saat ini, aktifkan \"Polling AT di bawah ModemManager\" di pengaturan modem."

msgid "Could not delete messages"
msgstr "Tidak dapat menghapus pesan"

msgid "Press [Enter] to send the code, press [Ctrl+Delete] to clear the field"
msgstr "Tekan [Enter] untuk mengirim kode, tekan [Ctrl+Delete] untuk mengosongkan kolom"

msgid "Press [Enter] to send the command, press [Ctrl+Delete] to clear the field"
msgstr "Tekan [Enter] untuk mengirim perintah, tekan [Ctrl+Delete] untuk mengosongkan kolom"

msgid "The request was rejected: %s"
msgstr "Permintaan ditolak: %s"

msgid "Dangerous AT command"
msgstr "Perintah AT berbahaya"

msgid "This command can change the modem composition or disable its ports for good. On some modules it removes all USB ports, and only reflashing over EDL brings them back."
msgstr "Perintah ini dapat mengubah komposisi modem atau menonaktifkan port-portnya secara permanen. Pada beberapa modul, perintah ini menghapus semua port USB, dan hanya flashing ulang melalui EDL yang dapat mengembalikannya."

msgid "Send anyway"
msgstr "Tetap kirim"

msgid "Could not switch the modem"
msgstr "Tidak dapat beralih modem"

msgid "The selected device is not a modem"
msgstr "Perangkat yang dipilih bukan modem"

msgid "No modem selected"
msgstr "Tidak ada modem yang dipilih"

msgid "256QAM (download)"
msgstr "256QAM (unduh)"

msgid "5G cell lock"
msgstr "Kunci sel 5G"

msgid "Enabling uplink aggregation — the modem is restarting its radio…"
msgstr "Mengaktifkan agregasi uplink — modem sedang memulai ulang radionya…"

msgid "Helps only with a strong signal and a base station that supports it"
msgstr "Hanya membantu dengan sinyal kuat dan stasiun pemancar yang mendukungnya"

msgid "Lock to current 5G cell"
msgstr "Kunci ke sel 5G saat ini"

msgid "Locked to cell: ARFCN %s, PCI %s"
msgstr "Terkunci ke sel: ARFCN %s, PCI %s"

msgid "Locking to cell ARFCN %s, PCI %s - the modem re-registers..."
msgstr "Mengunci ke sel ARFCN %s, PCI %s - modem mendaftar ulang..."

msgid "No 5G carrier right now - the lock needs its ARFCN and PCI"
msgstr "Saat ini tidak ada carrier 5G - penguncian memerlukan ARFCN dan PCI-nya"

msgid "Turn off"
msgstr "Matikan"

msgid "Turn on"
msgstr "Nyalakan"

msgid "Turning 256QAM off — the modem is restarting its radio…"
msgstr "Mematikan 256QAM — modem sedang memulai ulang radionya…"

msgid "Turning 256QAM on — the modem is restarting its radio…"
msgstr "Menyalakan 256QAM — modem sedang memulai ulang radionya…"

msgid "Uplink aggregation"
msgstr "Agregasi uplink"

msgid "Upload often sits at 1-2 Mbit/s until this is on"
msgstr "Kecepatan unggah sering tertahan di 1-2 Mbit/s sampai fitur ini dinyalakan"

msgid "(transmission rank)"
msgstr "(rank transmisi)"

msgid "Transmission rank: how many parallel data streams the network is really sending. 1 means SISO, 2 means MIMO 2x2."
msgstr "Rank transmisi: berapa banyak aliran data paralel yang benar-benar dikirim jaringan. 1 berarti SISO, 2 berarti MIMO 2x2."

msgid "Antennas"
msgstr "Antena"

msgid "Antenna mode"
msgstr "Mode antena"

msgid "Antenna %d"
msgstr "Antena %d"

msgid "Internal antennas"
msgstr "Antena internal"

msgid "External antennas"
msgstr "Antena eksternal"

msgid "Automatic: external where an antenna is detected"
msgstr "Otomatis: eksternal jika antena terdeteksi"

msgid "Mixed: antenna 1 automatic, antenna 2 internal"
msgstr "Campuran: antena 1 otomatis, antena 2 internal"

msgid "external"
msgstr "eksternal"

msgid "internal"
msgstr "internal"

msgid "antenna detected"
msgstr "antena terdeteksi"

msgid "no antenna detected"
msgstr "antena tidak terdeteksi"

msgid "detector unavailable"
msgstr "detektor tidak tersedia"

msgid "Applies immediately, no Save needed. Automatic modes check the connectors every 3 seconds. The detector only sees antennas that short the connector to ground; a passive antenna may stay undetected while plugged in."
msgstr "Diterapkan segera, tidak perlu Simpan. Mode otomatis memeriksa konektor setiap 3 detik. Detektor hanya mengenali antena yang menghubungkan konektor ke ground; antena pasif mungkin tetap tidak terdeteksi meski terpasang."

msgid "The modem is on the USB bus, but its AT port is not answering: it is busy or the modem is stuck. If this lasts, power-cycle the modem in Frequency management."
msgstr "Modem ada di bus USB, tetapi port AT-nya tidak merespons: sedang sibuk atau modem macet. Jika berlanjut, mati-nyalakan daya modem di Manajemen frekuensi."

msgid "No background AT polling"
msgstr "Tanpa polling AT latar belakang"

msgid "Stop all automatic AT exchange with this modem: metrics polling, the periodic SMS check, Telegram forwarding, SMS commands and archiving. Temperature, carrier aggregation and automatic SMS reception are lost; reading and sending SMS, USSD and the AT console still work when you use them. For firmware whose data session freezes more often while it is polled over AT (e.g. Quectel RM551E-GL)."
msgstr "Hentikan semua pertukaran AT otomatis dengan modem ini: polling metrik, pemeriksaan SMS berkala, penerusan Telegram, perintah SMS, dan pengarsipan. Suhu, agregasi carrier, dan penerimaan SMS otomatis akan hilang; membaca dan mengirim SMS, USSD, serta konsol AT tetap berfungsi saat Anda menggunakannya. Untuk firmware yang sesi datanya lebih sering macet saat di-polling melalui AT (mis. Quectel RM551E-GL)."

msgid "Background AT polling is off for this modem, so the current band selection is not read. Applying bands and mode still works."
msgstr "Polling AT latar belakang dinonaktifkan untuk modem ini, sehingga pilihan pita frekuensi saat ini tidak terbaca. Menerapkan pita dan mode tetap berfungsi."

msgid "Metrics are not polled: background AT polling is off"
msgstr "Metrik tidak di-polling: polling AT latar belakang dinonaktifkan"

msgid "Carrier aggregation enabled"
msgstr "Agregasi carrier diaktifkan"

msgid "Cell monitor"
msgstr "Monitor sel"

msgid "Channel quality (CQI)"
msgstr "Kualitas kanal (CQI)"

msgid "LTE RX diversity"
msgstr "Diversitas RX LTE"

msgid "LTE category limit"
msgstr "Batas kategori LTE"

msgid "Temperature sensors"
msgstr "Sensor suhu"

msgid "Thermal mitigation level"
msgstr "Tingkat mitigasi termal"

msgid "SIM slot (0 = slot 1, 1 = slot 2)"
msgstr "Slot SIM (0 = slot 1, 1 = slot 2)"

msgid "Firmware image (FN990)"
msgstr "Image firmware (FN990)"

msgid "Active firmware (LM960)"
msgstr "Firmware aktif (LM960)"

msgid "Firmware images (LM960)"
msgstr "Image firmware (LM960)"

msgid "History"
msgstr "Riwayat"

msgid "Each metric has its own scale. The dashed line is the average; a thin vertical line marks a cell or band change. Point at a chart to read the value."
msgstr "Setiap metrik memiliki skalanya sendiri. Garis putus-putus adalah rata-rata; garis vertikal tipis menandai pergantian sel atau pita. Arahkan ke grafik untuk membaca nilainya."

msgid "avg"
msgstr "rata-rata"

msgid "max"
msgstr "maks"

msgid "min"
msgstr "min"

msgid "RSRP / SINR"
msgstr "RSRP / SINR"

msgid "Show signal history"
msgstr "Tampilkan riwayat sinyal"

msgid "Show the collapsible \"History\" block on the Network page: RSRP, RSRQ, SINR and RSSI over the last 10 minutes. It is drawn from the data the page already polls and adds no load on the modem."
msgstr "Tampilkan blok \"Riwayat\" yang dapat dilipat di halaman Jaringan: RSRP, RSRQ, SINR, dan RSSI selama 10 menit terakhir. Digambar dari data yang sudah di-polling halaman dan tidak menambah beban pada modem."

msgid "Signal quality. On LTE -11 dB or better is excellent, below -17 dB is poor."
msgstr "Kualitas sinyal. Pada LTE -11 dB atau lebih baik adalah sangat baik, di bawah -17 dB buruk."

msgid "Signal strength received from the cell tower. On LTE -98 dBm or better is excellent, below -118 dBm is poor. 5G is graded on its own, stricter scale."
msgstr "Kekuatan sinyal yang diterima dari menara seluler. Pada LTE -98 dBm atau lebih baik adalah sangat baik, di bawah -118 dBm buruk. 5G dinilai dengan skalanya sendiri yang lebih ketat."

msgid "Signal-to-noise ratio. On LTE 13 dB or better is excellent, below 1 dB is poor."
msgstr "Rasio sinyal terhadap derau. Pada LTE 13 dB atau lebih baik adalah sangat baik, di bawah 1 dB buruk."

msgid "ModemManager did not pick up the modem in time"
msgstr "ModemManager tidak mengenali modem tepat waktu"

msgid "Not applied: %s"
msgstr "Tidak diterapkan: %s"

msgid "The previous band change is still being applied - wait until the modem reconnects."
msgstr "Perubahan pita sebelumnya masih diterapkan - tunggu hingga modem tersambung kembali."

msgid "Turning carrier aggregation on — the modem is rebooting (1-2 min)…"
msgstr "Menyalakan agregasi carrier — modem sedang dimulai ulang (1-2 menit)…"

msgid "band %s is not supported by the modem"
msgstr "pita %s tidak didukung oleh modem"

msgid "not supported by this modem"
msgstr "tidak didukung oleh modem ini"

msgid "the modem did not accept it"
msgstr "modem tidak menerimanya"

msgid "Collect signal in the background"
msgstr "Kumpulkan sinyal di latar belakang"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "Mati"

msgid "With the page closed the modem is not polled, so the signal charts stop. This polls the active modem on a timer to keep them going. Modems with background AT polling switched off are skipped."
msgstr "Saat halaman ditutup, modem tidak di-polling, sehingga grafik sinyal berhenti. Opsi ini mem-polling modem aktif dengan timer agar grafik tetap berjalan. Modem dengan polling AT latar belakang dinonaktifkan akan dilewati."

msgid "%s ago"
msgstr "%s yang lalu"

msgid "Allow roaming"
msgstr "Izinkan roaming"

msgid "MBIM+MM (shared proxy, ModemManager for management)"
msgstr "MBIM+MM (proxy bersama, ModemManager untuk manajemen)"

msgid "Deleted: %d, not deleted: %d"
msgstr "Dihapus: %d, tidak dihapus: %d"

msgid "Endpoint that accepts a POST body, for the upload test. \"Internetometer\" uses a node from the same probe list as the download source, and can be picked here on its own. Only uploads the server received in full are counted: an endpoint that cuts the transfer off early gives no upload figure at all."
msgstr "Endpoint yang menerima body POST, untuk uji unggah. \"Internetometer\" menggunakan node dari daftar probe yang sama dengan sumber unduhan, dan dapat dipilih di sini secara terpisah. Hanya unggahan yang diterima server secara utuh yang dihitung: endpoint yang memutus transfer lebih awal tidak memberikan angka unggah sama sekali."

msgid "The previous deletion is still running, try again in a minute"
msgstr "Penghapusan sebelumnya masih berjalan, coba lagi dalam satu menit"

msgid "Upload was not measured: the endpoint did not answer. Pick another upload endpoint in the settings."
msgstr "Unggah tidak terukur: endpoint tidak merespons. Pilih endpoint unggah lain di pengaturan."

msgid "Upload was not measured: the endpoint refused the data (HTTP %s). Pick another upload endpoint in the settings."
msgstr "Unggah tidak terukur: endpoint menolak data (HTTP %s). Pilih endpoint unggah lain di pengaturan."

msgid "could not remove the message from the router memory"
msgstr "tidak dapat menghapus pesan dari memori router"

msgid "the deletion stopped unexpectedly"
msgstr "penghapusan berhenti secara tak terduga"

msgid "the modem did not confirm the deletion"
msgstr "modem tidak mengonfirmasi penghapusan"

msgid "the modem has no AT port"
msgstr "modem tidak memiliki port AT"

msgid "the modem port is busy with another operation, try again in a minute"
msgstr "port modem sedang sibuk dengan operasi lain, coba lagi dalam satu menit"

msgid "the modem refused to delete the message"
msgstr "modem menolak menghapus pesan"

msgid "the modem refused to delete the message (error %s)"
msgstr "modem menolak menghapus pesan (galat %s)"

msgid "ModemManager is still picking up the modem: bands and network mode unlock by themselves in a minute or two, the connection is not affected."
msgstr "ModemManager masih mengenali modem: pita frekuensi dan mode jaringan akan terbuka sendiri dalam satu atau dua menit, koneksi tidak terpengaruh."

msgid "The browser keeps outdated files of this page. Clear the browser cache (Ctrl+Shift+R) and reload the page."
msgstr "Browser menyimpan berkas usang dari halaman ini. Bersihkan cache browser (Ctrl+Shift+R) dan muat ulang halaman."

msgid "Telegram is not reachable from the router: the direct path is blocked by the carrier and no working proxy tunnel was found. Choose your VPN tunnel in \"Interface for Telegram\" or start SSClash, save and try again."
msgstr "Telegram tidak dapat dijangkau dari router: jalur langsung diblokir oleh operator dan tidak ditemukan tunnel proxy yang berfungsi. Pilih tunnel VPN Anda di \"Antarmuka untuk Telegram\" atau jalankan SSClash, simpan, dan coba lagi."

msgid "Interface for Telegram"
msgstr "Antarmuka untuk Telegram"

msgid "Network interface the router uses to reach Telegram, e.g. a VPN tunnel (WireGuard, AmneziaWG) when the carrier blocks Telegram. Auto: the direct path, then the SSClash proxy."
msgstr "Antarmuka jaringan yang digunakan router untuk menjangkau Telegram, mis. tunnel VPN (WireGuard, AmneziaWG) jika operator memblokir Telegram. Otomatis: jalur langsung, lalu proxy SSClash."

msgid "SIM not detected: reinsert the card"
msgstr "SIM tidak terdeteksi: pasang ulang kartu"

msgid "Change network mode"
msgstr "Ubah mode jaringan"

msgid "The modem is on %s right now, and mode \"%s\" does not include it. If the network has nothing else here, the connection will drop."
msgstr "Modem saat ini berada di %s, dan mode \"%s\" tidak mencakupnya. Jika jaringan tidak menyediakan yang lain di sini, koneksi akan terputus."

msgid "Operator limit"
msgstr "Batas operator"

msgid "Speed ceiling the operator set for this connection (AMBR) and its QoS class (QCI). A low value explains a slow connection with a good signal."
msgstr "Batas kecepatan yang ditetapkan operator untuk koneksi ini (AMBR) dan kelas QoS-nya (QCI). Nilai rendah menjelaskan koneksi lambat meski sinyal bagus."

msgid "What alignment is for."
msgstr "Untuk apa penyelarasan."

msgid "An outdoor or directional antenna works best when it points precisely at a base station. This page shows the signal live, every few seconds, so you can turn the antenna and see at once whether it got better or worse."
msgstr "Antena luar ruang atau terarah bekerja paling baik jika diarahkan tepat ke stasiun pemancar. Halaman ini menampilkan sinyal secara langsung, setiap beberapa detik, sehingga Anda dapat memutar antena dan langsung melihat apakah sinyal membaik atau memburuk."

msgid "How to use it:"
msgstr "Cara menggunakannya:"

msgid "Turn the antenna slowly, a few degrees at a time, and wait for a couple of readings after each step."
msgstr "Putar antena perlahan, beberapa derajat setiap kali, dan tunggu beberapa pembacaan setelah setiap langkah."

msgid "Watch SINR first: it decides the speed. RSRP and RSRQ help confirm the direction."
msgstr "Perhatikan SINR terlebih dahulu: ini yang menentukan kecepatan. RSRP dan RSRQ membantu memastikan arah."

msgid "Turn on the sound to follow the signal without looking at the screen: the faster the clicks, the better."
msgstr "Nyalakan suara untuk mengikuti sinyal tanpa melihat layar: semakin cepat bunyi klik, semakin baik."

msgid "The table of best cells remembers where the signal was strongest; click a row to make that cell the target."
msgstr "Tabel sel terbaik mengingat di mana sinyal paling kuat; klik baris untuk menjadikan sel tersebut sebagai target."

msgid "When the numbers stop improving, fix the antenna in the best position."
msgstr "Jika angka tidak lagi membaik, kencangkan antena di posisi terbaik."

msgid "%d more bands supported by the modem, %d of them enabled"
msgstr "%d pita lagi didukung oleh modem, %d di antaranya diaktifkan"

msgid "(%d enabled)"
msgstr "(%d diaktifkan)"

msgid "Hide bands not used by operators in this country"
msgstr "Sembunyikan pita yang tidak digunakan operator di negara ini"

msgid "Show fewer"
msgstr "Tampilkan lebih sedikit"

msgid "Signal quality. On LTE %d dB or better is excellent, below %d dB is poor; on 5G below %d dB is poor."
msgstr "Kualitas sinyal. Pada LTE %d dB atau lebih baik adalah sangat baik, di bawah %d dB buruk; pada 5G di bawah %d dB buruk."

msgid "Signal strength received from the cell tower. On LTE and 5G %d dBm or better is excellent, below %d dBm is poor."
msgstr "Kekuatan sinyal yang diterima dari menara seluler. Pada LTE dan 5G %d dBm atau lebih baik adalah sangat baik, di bawah %d dBm buruk."

msgid "Signal-to-noise ratio. On LTE and 5G %d dB or better is excellent, below %d dB is poor."
msgstr "Rasio sinyal terhadap derau. Pada LTE dan 5G %d dB atau lebih baik adalah sangat baik, di bawah %d dB buruk."

msgid "The modem is on the USB bus, but its AT port is not answering: it is busy or the modem is stuck. If this lasts, restart the modem with the Restart modem buttons below."
msgstr "Modem ada di bus USB, tetapi port AT-nya tidak merespons: sedang sibuk atau modem macet. Jika berlanjut, mulai ulang modem dengan tombol Mulai ulang modem di bawah."

msgid "Total power received in the channel, including noise and interference. On LTE %d dBm or better is excellent, below %d dBm is poor."
msgstr "Total daya yang diterima di kanal, termasuk derau dan interferensi. Pada LTE %d dBm atau lebih baik adalah sangat baik, di bawah %d dBm buruk."

msgid "cell quality · good from %d dB"
msgstr "kualitas sel · baik mulai %d dB"

msgid "signal power · good from %d dBm"
msgstr "daya sinyal · baik mulai %d dBm"

msgid "signal-to-noise · good from %d dB"
msgstr "sinyal terhadap derau · baik mulai %d dB"

msgid "Arrange blocks"
msgstr "Atur blok"

msgid "Reset order"
msgstr "Atur ulang urutan"

msgid "Done"
msgstr "Selesai"

msgid "Hide"
msgstr "Sembunyikan"

msgid "Drag to move, or use the arrow keys"
msgstr "Seret untuk memindahkan, atau gunakan tombol panah"

msgid "Could not save the block order"
msgstr "Tidak dapat menyimpan urutan blok"

msgid "Hi! I really like your app. How can I thank you?"
msgstr "Halo! Saya sangat suka aplikasi Anda. Bagaimana saya bisa berterima kasih?"

msgid "Signal"
msgstr "Sinyal"

msgid "More"
msgstr "Lainnya"

msgid "Carriers"
msgstr "Carrier"

msgid "New mobile view"
msgstr "Tampilan seluler baru"

msgid "On phones the Network page gets a summary bar, tabs and signal tiles. Turn off to get the previous layout back."
msgstr "Di ponsel, halaman Jaringan mendapat bilah ringkasan, tab, dan ubin sinyal. Matikan untuk kembali ke tata letak sebelumnya."

msgid "SIM card and modem memory (MT)"
msgstr "Kartu SIM dan memori modem (MT)"

msgid "While locked to one cell the modem usually stops carrier aggregation, so the speed may drop."
msgstr "Saat terkunci ke satu sel, modem biasanya menghentikan agregasi carrier, sehingga kecepatan dapat turun."

msgid "Internet priorities only"
msgstr "Hanya prioritas internet"

msgid "For a router without a modem: keeps uplink priorities, the internet watchdog, statistics, buttons and the Telegram bot, and turns off everything that serves a modem - polling, SMS, ModemManager control, USB port binding. Modem tabs and settings are hidden."
msgstr "Untuk router tanpa modem: mempertahankan prioritas uplink, pengawas koneksi internet, statistik, tombol, dan bot Telegram, serta mematikan semua yang melayani modem - polling, SMS, kontrol ModemManager, pengikatan port USB. Tab dan pengaturan modem disembunyikan."

msgid "Modem web password"
msgstr "Kata sandi web modem"

msgid "Modem battery"
msgstr "Baterai modem"

msgid "Modem battery, charging"
msgstr "Baterai modem, mengisi daya"

msgid "The password of the modem's own web interface (user admin). With it the router reads signal, battery, SMS and can reboot the modem. Empty means admin, the factory password of most such modems."
msgstr "Kata sandi antarmuka web modem itu sendiri (pengguna admin). Dengan itu router membaca sinyal, baterai, SMS dan dapat me-reboot modem. Kosong berarti admin, kata sandi pabrik sebagian besar modem semacam ini."

msgid "The modem asks for its web password - enter it on the Modem page"
msgstr "Modem meminta kata sandi webnya - masukkan di halaman Modem"

msgid "Password needed"
msgstr "Kata sandi diperlukan"

msgid "Internetometer"
msgstr "Internetometer"

msgid "Internetometer (Yandex CDN)"
msgstr "Internetometer (Yandex CDN)"

msgid "Updated"
msgstr "Diperbarui"

msgid "Time of the latest modem data; the bar runs until the next update"
msgstr "Waktu data modem terbaru; bilah berjalan hingga pembaruan berikutnya"

msgid "Add router name"
msgstr "Tambahkan nama router"

msgid "Message header: SMS sender, then the SIM operator and number, router name and modem, e.g. \"SMS 900 → MTS +79001234567 · OpenWrt (Quectel EC25)\". Helps when several routers send to one chat."
msgstr "Header pesan: pengirim SMS, lalu operator dan nomor SIM, nama router, dan modem, mis. \"SMS 900 → MTS +79001234567 · OpenWrt (Quectel EC25)\". Membantu jika beberapa router mengirim ke satu chat."

msgid "Subject: SMS sender, then the SIM operator and number, router name and modem, e.g. \"SMS 900 → MTS +79001234567 · OpenWrt (Quectel EC25)\"."
msgstr "Subjek: pengirim SMS, lalu operator dan nomor SIM, nama router, dan modem, mis. \"SMS 900 → MTS +79001234567 · OpenWrt (Quectel EC25)\"."

msgid "ntfy notifications"
msgstr "Notifikasi ntfy"

msgid "Forwards every new incoming SMS to an ntfy topic (ntfy.sh or your own server). Subscribe to the topic in the ntfy app on the phone."
msgstr "Meneruskan setiap SMS masuk baru ke topik ntfy (ntfy.sh atau server Anda sendiri). Berlangganan topik tersebut di aplikasi ntfy pada ponsel."

msgid "ntfy server"
msgstr "Server ntfy"

msgid "Topic"
msgstr "Topik"

msgid "Anyone who knows the topic name on ntfy.sh can read it - pick a long, hard to guess name."
msgstr "Siapa pun yang mengetahui nama topik di ntfy.sh dapat membacanya - pilih nama yang panjang dan sulit ditebak."

msgid "Only Latin letters, digits, \"-\" and \"_\""
msgstr "Hanya huruf Latin, angka, \"-\" dan \"_\""

msgid "Access token"
msgstr "Token akses"

msgid "Only for protected topics, e.g. tk_..."
msgstr "Hanya untuk topik yang dilindungi, mis. tk_..."

msgid "Webhook"
msgstr "Webhook"

msgid "Sends every new incoming SMS as a JSON POST request: title, sender, time, text, router, modem, operator, phone, path. Suits Home Assistant, n8n, Gotify proxies and your own scripts."
msgstr "Mengirim setiap SMS masuk baru sebagai permintaan POST JSON: judul, pengirim, waktu, teks, router, modem, operator, telepon, path. Cocok untuk Home Assistant, n8n, proxy Gotify, dan skrip Anda sendiri."

msgid "URL"
msgstr "URL"

msgid "Expecting an http:// or https:// address"
msgstr "Diharapkan alamat http:// atau https://"

msgid "Extra header"
msgstr "Header tambahan"

msgid "Optional, one header in the form Name: value, e.g. Authorization: Bearer secret"
msgstr "Opsional, satu header dalam bentuk Name: value, mis. Authorization: Bearer secret"

msgid "Expecting Name: value"
msgstr "Diharapkan Name: value"

msgid "check the address and the router internet connection"
msgstr "periksa alamat dan koneksi internet router"

msgid "Colored modem card"
msgstr "Kartu modem berwarna"

msgid "Tint the Modem card on the Network page by network technology: purple for 5G, blue for 4G, green for 3G, pink for 2G. Turn off to get the previous plain card back."
msgstr "Beri warna kartu Modem di halaman Jaringan sesuai teknologi jaringan: ungu untuk 5G, biru untuk 4G, hijau untuk 3G, merah muda untuk 2G. Matikan untuk kembali ke kartu polos sebelumnya."

msgid "Carrier aggregation: %d carriers combined, %d MHz in total"
msgstr "Agregasi carrier: %d carrier digabungkan, total %d MHz"

msgid "Carrier aggregation: %d carriers combined"
msgstr "Agregasi carrier: %d carrier digabungkan"

msgid "Phone"
msgstr "Ponsel"

msgid "%s shares internet over USB."
msgstr "%s berbagi internet melalui USB."

msgid "Signal, operator and SMS are not available from a phone."
msgstr "Sinyal, operator, dan SMS tidak tersedia dari ponsel."

msgid "%s is connected but does not share internet. Turn on USB tethering on the phone."
msgstr "%s terhubung tetapi tidak berbagi internet. Nyalakan USB tethering di ponsel."

msgid "A router shares internet over USB."
msgstr "Sebuah router berbagi internet melalui USB."

msgid "This router got the address %s from it."
msgstr "Router ini mendapatkan alamat %s darinya."

msgid "Open its admin page (%s)"
msgstr "Buka halaman adminnya (%s)"

msgid "Signal, operator and SMS are managed on that router."
msgstr "Sinyal, operator, dan SMS dikelola di router tersebut."

msgid "A router is connected over USB but has not given an address yet."
msgstr "Sebuah router terhubung melalui USB tetapi belum memberikan alamat."

msgid "iPhone shares internet over USB."
msgstr "iPhone berbagi internet melalui USB."

msgid "Address: %s."
msgstr "Alamat: %s."

msgid "Signal, operator and SMS are not available from an iPhone."
msgstr "Sinyal, operator, dan SMS tidak tersedia dari iPhone."

msgid "iPhone is connected but does not share internet. Turn on Personal Hotspot on the iPhone."
msgstr "iPhone terhubung tetapi tidak berbagi internet. Nyalakan Personal Hotspot di iPhone."

msgid "iPhone is connected. To use it as a USB modem, install the usbmuxd and kmod-usb-net-ipheth packages."
msgstr "iPhone terhubung. Untuk menggunakannya sebagai modem USB, instal paket usbmuxd dan kmod-usb-net-ipheth."

msgid "iPhone is connected. Unlock it, tap Trust on the iPhone and turn on Personal Hotspot."
msgstr "iPhone terhubung. Buka kuncinya, ketuk Trust di iPhone, dan nyalakan Personal Hotspot."

msgid "This modem does not let the router change bands or network mode."
msgstr "Modem ini tidak mengizinkan router mengubah pita frekuensi atau mode jaringan."

msgid "This modem does not let the router change bands. Only the network mode can be switched."
msgstr "Modem ini tidak mengizinkan router mengubah pita frekuensi. Hanya mode jaringan yang dapat diganti."

msgid "Telemetry"
msgstr "Telemetri"

msgid "A small JSON file with the modem signal, operator, band and traffic for a smart home, an external display or another router. It never contains IMEI, IMSI, ICCID or cell IDs, and the phone number only if you turn it on below."
msgstr "Berkas JSON kecil berisi sinyal, operator, pita, dan trafik modem untuk rumah pintar, layar eksternal, atau router lain. Berkas ini tidak pernah berisi IMEI, IMSI, ICCID, atau ID sel, dan nomor telepon hanya jika Anda menyalakannya di bawah."

msgid "Export telemetry"
msgstr "Ekspor telemetri"

msgid "Keep /tmp/5gmodem/tele.json up to date. It is written from the metrics the app already collects and sends no extra requests to the modem."
msgstr "Jaga /tmp/5gmodem/tele.json tetap terbaru. Ditulis dari metrik yang sudah dikumpulkan aplikasi dan tidak mengirim permintaan tambahan ke modem."

msgid "Publish over HTTP"
msgstr "Publikasikan melalui HTTP"

msgid "Serve the file at %s. Anyone on the LAN can read it without a password. Another router with this app that gets internet from this one over USB will then show its signal and operator."
msgstr "Sajikan berkas di %s. Siapa pun di LAN dapat membacanya tanpa kata sandi. Router lain dengan aplikasi ini yang mendapat internet dari router ini melalui USB akan menampilkan sinyal dan operatornya."

msgid "Include addresses"
msgstr "Sertakan alamat"

msgid "Add the carrier address and the external address to the published file and to MQTT. Off by default: a stream of addresses with timestamps is a log of when the address changed and when the router was on."
msgstr "Tambahkan alamat operator dan alamat eksternal ke berkas yang dipublikasikan dan ke MQTT. Nonaktif secara bawaan: aliran alamat dengan stempel waktu merupakan log kapan alamat berubah dan kapan router menyala."

msgid "MQTT broker"
msgstr "Broker MQTT"

msgid "Address of the broker. Leave empty to keep MQTT off. Needs the mosquitto-client package."
msgstr "Alamat broker. Biarkan kosong agar MQTT tetap mati. Memerlukan paket mosquitto-client."

msgid "MQTT port"
msgstr "Port MQTT"

msgid "MQTT user"
msgstr "Pengguna MQTT"

msgid "MQTT password"
msgstr "Kata sandi MQTT"

msgid "Device name"
msgstr "Nama perangkat"

msgid "Used in the MQTT topic and in Home Assistant. Empty - the router hostname."
msgstr "Digunakan dalam topik MQTT dan di Home Assistant. Kosong - nama host router."

msgid "MQTT topic"
msgstr "Topik MQTT"

msgid "Empty - 5gmodem/ followed by the device name. The state is published to the topic with /state appended."
msgstr "Kosong - 5gmodem/ diikuti nama perangkat. Status dipublikasikan ke topik dengan tambahan /state."

msgid "Home Assistant"
msgstr "Home Assistant"

msgid "Announce the sensors to Home Assistant over MQTT discovery. Save the broker settings first."
msgstr "Umumkan sensor ke Home Assistant melalui MQTT discovery. Simpan pengaturan broker terlebih dahulu."

msgid "Announce sensors"
msgstr "Umumkan sensor"

msgid "Sending…"
msgstr "Mengirim…"

msgid "mosquitto_pub is not installed: install the mosquitto-client-nossl package."
msgstr "mosquitto_pub tidak terpasang: instal paket mosquitto-client-nossl."

msgid "The broker is not saved yet: press Save first."
msgstr "Broker belum disimpan: tekan Simpan terlebih dahulu."

msgid "The broker did not accept the announcement."
msgstr "Broker tidak menerima pengumuman."

msgid "Sensors announced. They appear in Home Assistant under MQTT devices."
msgstr "Sensor telah diumumkan. Sensor muncul di Home Assistant di bawah perangkat MQTT."

msgid "Include the phone number"
msgstr "Sertakan nomor telepon"

msgid "Add the SIM phone number to the published file and to MQTT, so that a router getting internet from this one over USB shows it too. Off by default: anyone on the LAN and everyone with access to the broker will see the number."
msgstr "Tambahkan nomor telepon SIM ke berkas yang dipublikasikan dan ke MQTT, agar router yang mendapat internet dari router ini melalui USB juga menampilkannya. Nonaktif secara bawaan: siapa pun di LAN dan semua yang memiliki akses ke broker akan melihat nomor tersebut."

msgid "Signal quality (RSRP, RSRQ, RSSI)"
msgstr "Kualitas sinyal (RSRP, RSRQ, RSSI)"

msgid "Serving and neighbour cells"
msgstr "Sel penyaji dan sel tetangga"

msgid "Network type and domain"
msgstr "Jenis dan domain jaringan"

msgid "Uplink aggregation (read)"
msgstr "Agregasi uplink (baca)"

msgid "Copy the code"
msgstr "Salin kode"

msgid "The browser did not allow copying. Select the code and copy it:"
msgstr "Browser tidak mengizinkan penyalinan. Pilih kode lalu salin:"

msgid "Click to copy the code"
msgstr "Klik untuk menyalin kode"

msgid "Network selection"
msgstr "Pemilihan jaringan"

msgid "Pick the operator network by hand instead of letting the modem choose. The search takes 1-3 minutes."
msgstr "Pilih jaringan operator secara manual alih-alih membiarkan modem memilih. Pencarian memakan waktu 1-3 menit."

msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Otomatis"

msgid "Find networks"
msgstr "Cari jaringan"

msgid "Return to automatic if this network is lost"
msgstr "Kembali ke otomatis jika jaringan ini hilang"

msgid "current"
msgstr "saat ini"

msgid "forbidden"
msgstr "terlarang"

msgid "Choose a network"
msgstr "Pilih jaringan"

msgid "No networks yet - press \"Find networks\""
msgstr "Belum ada jaringan - tekan \"Cari jaringan\""

msgid "Saved. The modem is switching networks, this can take up to a minute."
msgstr "Tersimpan. Modem sedang berpindah jaringan, ini bisa memakan waktu hingga satu menit."

msgid "Could not apply the network selection"
msgstr "Tidak dapat menerapkan pemilihan jaringan"

msgid "Searching for networks (%d s). The connection may drop meanwhile."
msgstr "Mencari jaringan (%d dtk). Koneksi mungkin terputus selama itu."

msgid "The modem found no networks"
msgstr "Modem tidak menemukan jaringan"

msgid "The modem port is busy, try again in a minute"
msgstr "Port modem sedang sibuk, coba lagi dalam satu menit"

msgid "The search failed"
msgstr "Pencarian gagal"

msgid "The network is selected manually on the Modem tab"
msgstr "Jaringan dipilih secara manual di tab Modem"

msgid "manual"
msgstr "manual"

msgid "Radio amplifier"
msgstr "Penguat radio"

msgid "Processor"
msgstr "Prosesor"

msgid "Wi-Fi"
msgstr "Wi-Fi"

msgid "Power controller"
msgstr "Pengendali daya"

msgid "Battery"
msgstr "Baterai"

msgid "Charger"
msgstr "Pengisi daya"

msgid "Board"
msgstr "Papan"

msgid "Install the %s package to switch bands and see RSRQ, SINR and the cell on this modem."
msgstr "Pasang paket %s untuk mengganti band serta melihat RSRQ, SINR, dan sel pada modem ini."

msgid "Telegram API server"
msgstr "Server API Telegram"

msgid "Leave empty for api.telegram.org. Your own server must forward the Bot API as is, e.g. an SNI proxy or a self-hosted Bot API server."
msgstr "Kosongkan untuk api.telegram.org. Server Anda harus meneruskan Bot API apa adanya, misalnya proxy SNI atau server Bot API sendiri."

msgid "Expecting an address starting with http:// or https://"
msgstr "Diharapkan alamat yang diawali http:// atau https://"

msgid "Do not check the certificate"
msgstr "Jangan periksa sertifikat"

msgid "Only for your own server: accept a self-signed or mismatching certificate."
msgstr "Hanya untuk server Anda sendiri: terima sertifikat self-signed atau yang tidak cocok."

msgid "...plus power cycle (USB port or your script)"
msgstr "...plus siklus daya (port USB atau skrip Anda)"

msgid "Power script"
msgstr "Skrip daya"

msgid "Expecting an absolute path made of letters, digits and / . _ -"
msgstr "Diharapkan path absolut dari huruf, angka, dan / . _ -"

msgid "For boards without USB power control: an executable that cuts and restores the modem power (for example toggles a GPIO). The power step runs it instead of switching the USB port off, with the interface, the modem USB path and its AT port as arguments. Its output goes to the system log."
msgstr "Untuk papan tanpa kontrol daya USB: berkas eksekusi yang memutus dan memulihkan daya modem (misalnya mengubah GPIO). Langkah daya menjalankannya sebagai pengganti mematikan port USB, dengan argumen antarmuka, path USB modem, dan port AT-nya. Keluarannya masuk ke log sistem."

msgid "Modem status LED"
msgstr "LED status modem"

msgid "Blue: LTE and the connection is up. Green: registered on 3G or 2G. Blinking red: no service or no connection. Applies immediately, no Save needed."
msgstr "Biru: LTE dan koneksi aktif. Hijau: terdaftar di 3G atau 2G. Merah berkedip: tidak ada layanan atau tidak terhubung. Langsung berlaku, tidak perlu Simpan."

msgid "Delete from the modem after forwarding"
msgstr "Hapus dari modem setelah diteruskan"

msgid "A message is deleted from the modem once every enabled channel (Telegram, ntfy, webhook) has delivered it and, if enabled, the SMS commands have seen it. Without \"Keep messages in router memory\" it then disappears from the Inbox too."
msgstr "Pesan dihapus dari modem setelah semua saluran yang aktif (Telegram, ntfy, webhook) mengirimkannya dan, jika aktif, perintah SMS sudah memeriksanya. Tanpa \"Simpan pesan di memori router\", pesan juga hilang dari Kotak Masuk."

msgid "Follow network address changes"
msgstr "Pantau perubahan alamat oleh jaringan"

msgid "Checks the data session every few seconds. When the operator drops the session or assigns a new address (for example, a forced reconnect every few hours), the interface reconnects and takes the new address."
msgstr "Memeriksa sesi data setiap beberapa detik. Jika operator memutus sesi atau memberikan alamat baru (misalnya, menyambung ulang paksa setiap beberapa jam), antarmuka tersambung ulang dan mengambil alamat baru."

msgid "From 5 to 3600 seconds"
msgstr "Dari 5 hingga 3600 detik"

msgid "MediaTek built-in modem (CCMNI)"
msgstr "Modem bawaan MediaTek (CCMNI)"

msgid "Registration timeout, s"
msgstr "Batas waktu registrasi, dtk"

msgid "The active eSIM has no profile: switch to the physical SIM or download a profile"
msgstr "eSIM aktif tidak memiliki profil: beralih ke SIM fisik atau unduh profil"

msgid "As set in the modem"
msgstr "Sesuai pengaturan modem"

msgid "Not enough free space in /tmp to download the update."
msgstr "Ruang kosong di /tmp tidak cukup untuk mengunduh pembaruan."

msgid "Could not download the update from GitHub. Check the internet connection and try again."
msgstr "Gagal mengunduh pembaruan dari GitHub. Periksa koneksi internet lalu coba lagi."

msgid "The download was interrupted: the file is incomplete. Try again."
msgstr "Unduhan terputus: berkas tidak lengkap. Coba lagi."

msgid "The package manager refuses to install anything: /etc/apk/world lists %s, which apk cannot find (usually a package installed from a file). If that package is no longer installed, delete its line from /etc/apk/world; otherwise install it again from its file. Then try the update again."
msgstr "Manajer paket menolak memasang apa pun: /etc/apk/world mencantumkan %s, yang tidak dapat ditemukan apk (biasanya paket yang dipasang dari file). Jika paket itu sudah tidak terpasang, hapus barisnya dari /etc/apk/world; jika masih, pasang lagi dari filenya. Lalu coba pembaruan lagi."

msgid "The package manager could not install the update."
msgstr "Pengelola paket gagal memasang pembaruan."

msgid "The package was installed, but the version did not change. The release file looks broken."
msgstr "Paket terpasang, tetapi versinya tidak berubah. Berkas rilis tampaknya rusak."


msgid "Downloading: %d of %d KB"
msgstr "Mengunduh: %d dari %d KB"

msgid "Downloading: %d KB"
msgstr "Mengunduh: %d KB"

msgid "Installing the package…"
msgstr "Memasang paket…"

msgid "Finishing: refreshing translations and caches…"
msgstr "Menyelesaikan: memperbarui terjemahan dan cache…"

msgid "Preparing: reading the release…"
msgstr "Menyiapkan: membaca data rilis…"

msgid "Lost contact with the router during the update."
msgstr "Koneksi ke router terputus saat pembaruan."

msgid "Could not reach GitHub"
msgstr "Tidak dapat menghubungi GitHub"
